# Production API origin (docs/02 §subdomain + docs/08): the SPA is served from
# unify-cs.ac.ir, Laravel from api.unify-cs.ac.ir — the bundle must call the
# api subdomain explicitly or same-origin /api/v1 lands on the SPA fallback
# (index.html), which silently breaks EVERY API call. vite.config.ts reads
# this via process.env.VITE_API_URL into the __UNIFY_API_URL__ define.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.unify-cs.ac.ir/api/v1
